     "Christian teaching should be examined carefully in the light of Scripture.",
     "Defending the faith requires both conviction and humility.",
     "Personal opinions should not automatically be treated as fundamental Christian doctrine.",
     "Honest disagreement is better than misrepresentation or hostility.",
     "Leaders should equip believers to understand and practise the faith for themselves."
