     "Leaders must protect sound teaching without becoming proud or controlling.",
     "Pressure reveals whether a person’s commitments are deeply rooted.",
     "A title does not replace the need for humility and integrity.",
     "Faithful leaders continue to serve even when their circumstances become difficult."
