     "Why do some people search for truth beyond the beliefs they inherited?",
     "What is the difference between gaining knowledge and becoming wise?",
     "How can a Christian respond when someone has difficult questions about God?",
     "Are you willing to examine your own beliefs honestly? Why or why not?"
