     "Christian apologetics is the practice of explaining and defending Christian beliefs through reasoned argument, evidence, and thoughtful engagement with questions or objections.",
     "It is not necessarily about winning every debate. At its best, it helps people understand what Christians believe, why they believe it, and how those beliefs relate to the evidence and questions being discussed.",
