     "Use theological language responsibly. Understand the meaning of a term rather than repeating it without comprehension.",
     "Recognize historical development. The language used to explain Christian beliefs developed over time.",
     "Keep theology connected to Scripture. The purpose of theological reflection is to help believers understand the biblical witness faithfully.",
     "Learn from earlier Christian thinkers without treating them as infallible. Their contributions can be valuable while still requiring careful historical and theological evaluation."
