     "His story teaches us that Christians do not have to fear serious questions. Nor should they assume that every popular idea is true simply because it sounds intelligent.",
     "The goal is not to win every argument. It is to seek truth, communicate faithfully, and demonstrate the character of Christ while engaging with people who think differently.",
