     "The desire to defend a preferred interpretation must not determine the evidence.",
     "Origen’s work became an important part of the history of biblical scholarship. Although the Hexapla survives only in fragments and through later evidence, its ambition demonstrates how seriously he approached the task of understanding Scripture.",
     "His example reminds modern disciples that responsible Bible study includes respect for the text itself. We should not alter the meaning of Scripture simply to make it fit our assumptions."
