     "5. What is the difference between seeking knowledge to serve others and seeking knowledge to impress others?",
     "6. How can you make your Bible study more consistent?",
     "7. What safeguards can help you avoid accepting an unsupported interpretation?",
     "8. How can you learn from historical Christian teachers without treating them as infallible?",
