   "2. Explain the central disagreement between Arius and Athanasius concerning the nature of Jesus Christ.",
   "3. Understand why the divinity of Christ became a major question in the early Church.",
   "4. Explain the historical significance of the Council of Nicaea in AD 325.",
   "5. Identify the importance of the Nicene Creed in expressing the Church’s understanding of the Son’s relationship to the Father.",
   "6. Describe Athanasius’s role in defending Nicene Christianity.",
   "7. Understand why Athanasius experienced repeated periods of exile.",
