   "Story Focus: How three influential Christian teachers—Basil the Great, Gregory of Nazianzus, and Gregory of Nyssa—helped the Church explain its confession of one God in three Persons, defend the divinity of the Holy Spirit, and strengthen the theological foundations of Nicene Christianity.",
   "Primary Scriptures: Matthew 28:19; John 1:1–3; John 14:16–17; John 14:26; John 15:26; John 16:13–15; John 17:20–23; Acts 5:3–4; 1 Corinthians 8:4–6; 2 Corinthians 13:14; Ephesians 4:4–6.",
