   "Heavenly Father,",
   "Thank You for the gift of Your Word and for the generations of Christians who have sought to understand and faithfully communicate the truth of the Gospel.",
   "Thank You for the lives and contributions of Basil of Caesarea, Gregory of Nazianzus, and Gregory of Nyssa. Through their example, remind us of the importance of careful study, courageous conviction, humble reflection, and faithful service.",
