   "PART C — DEEPER REFLECTION QUESTIONS",
   "1. Why is it important to distinguish between knowing God and comprehending God completely?",
   "Suggested Reflection: Christians believe that God has revealed Himself truly, but human understanding remains limited. Recognising this distinction encourages serious study without arrogance and allows mystery to deepen worship rather than end inquiry.",
