   "A. Faith has no connection to practical behaviour.",
   "B. Faith should be accompanied by practical action.",
   "C. Only wealthy people can demonstrate faith.",
   "D. Helping others is unnecessary.",
   "10. What was important about Basil’s approach to Christian community?",
   "A. He emphasised individual achievement above everything else.",
   "B. He rejected prayer and shared work.",
   "C. He encouraged disciplined communal life, prayer, work, and responsibility.",
