     "His ministry was not without difficulty. Political and theological opponents challenged his leadership, and he was eventually removed from his position for a period. He later returned to prominence and continued contributing to Christian thought.",
     "Gregory's experience reveals that leadership does not guarantee an easy life. Sometimes a person's responsibilities place them directly in the middle of difficult questions.",
